Deliver next-frame callbacks without the test-support feature

A window run on gpui's headless platform has no frame loop, so the
callbacks on_next_frame and request_animation_frame schedule never run,
and an animated state never settles. simulate_next_frame delivers them,
but only to builds with the test-support feature, which changes the
features of gpui for every crate built alongside. Offer it in every build,
so that a test drawing panels headlessly can settle them.

